      "subject": "ערירי",
      "rationale": "Daɲɛ in kɔrɔ ye 'densonkunbaliya' ye (den si t'a bolo) walima 'min bɛden o tɛ a bolo' — bayɛlɛmabaga caman bɛ fɔ 'childless'; KJV ni JPS ta 'childless', n'a bɛ se ka kɛ 'danga-ni-fɔli' ye fana."
