      "subject": "איש יושב",
      "rationale": "Fɔli wɛrɛ: 'cɛ si tɛna ɲɛ ka sigi Dawid ka faamu kan' — KJV ka cogoya — walima 'a kisɛ la cɛ si tɛna sigi' (n'i ye yɔrɔ wɛrɛ la) ni yɔrɔjɔyɔrɔ taali ma ke lasɔminɛ ye."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Nin cogo na Yawe fɔ ko: Aw ye ⟨את⟩ mɔgɔ in sɛbɛn — ⟨o ye⟩ cɛ min tɛna den sɔrɔ, kunben tɛna ɲɛ a tilew kɔnɔ; sabu a kisɛ la, cɛ si tɛna ɲɛ ka sigi Dawid ka faamu kan, ka tuguni Yuda ɲɛmɔ.",
